  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2016/01/P1280959.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 360px;\" /></p>\n<p>(30 fotos) La nit d&#39;aquest dissabte el grup Sisosix (en realitat, aquesta vegada, Cincosix) ha oferit una magn&iacute;fic concert a la Cateferia Druida, del carrer d&#39;Ausi&agrave;s March, 45 d&#39;Onda, amb temes standard de jazz, bossa nova i algunes altres versions. En el grup toca el baix l&#39;onder Joan Guinot i hi ha components tamb&eacute; de Nules, Benic&agrave;ssim, Castell&oacute; de la Plana i el Grau de Castell&oacute;.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertsisosixdruida020116/p1280959.jpg\" alt=\"p1280959\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertsisosixdruida020116/p1280960.jpg\" alt=\"p1280960\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertsisosixdruida020116/p1280962.jpg\" alt=\"p1280962\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertsisosixdruida020116/p1280963.jpg\" alt=\"p1280963\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertsisosixdruida020116/p1280965.jpg\" alt=\"p1280965\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertsisosixdruida020116/p1280967.jpg\" alt=\"p1280967\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertsisosixdruida020116/p1280968.jpg\" alt=\"p1280968\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/concertsisosixdruida020116/p1280971.jpg\" alt=\"p1280971\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img s